{"4396110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NOSBALL", "steam_appid": 4396110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396110/extras/67f0c12bb8b182560385398607fc21f9.poster.avif?t=1780553669\" width=720 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396110/extras/67f0c12bb8b182560385398607fc21f9.webm?t=1780553669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396110/extras/67f0c12bb8b182560385398607fc21f9.mp4?t=1780553669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nosball is a high-skill, adrenaline-fueled car drifting soccer game that blends fast-paced sports action with demolition derby chaos. Precision driving, controlled drifting, and smart positioning are key as you battle for the ball while your car takes real damage from intense collisions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matches take place inside dangerous, pinball-styled arenas packed with obstacles that constantly disrupt the flow of play. Walls, ramps, and hazards turn every match into a high-speed test of control, timing, and survival, where one mistake can send your car flying, or completely destroy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396110/extras/9ae4f38c0435b53ff06e6dab547d5c27.avif?t=1780553669\" width=720 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stadium delivers a unique atmosphere, with locations inspired by real-world places from around the globe, including iconic settings like Mount Fuji. Dynamic weather conditions further raise the challenge, forcing players to adapt their driving style and master the physics in every match. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nosball is not about auto-aim or easy wins. It rewards skill, practice, and creativity, combining drifting, destruction, and soccer into a chaotic competitive experience. Fast, unforgiving, and built for players who want something more intense than traditional car soccer this is Nosball. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Yeah… some might call it a Rocket killer 😉)</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396110/extras/abe19842a6a74e8dcfe846f386b2490b.avif?t=1780553669\" width=720 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-Skill Car Drifting Soccer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demolition Derby Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball-Style Arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-Based Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrenaline-Filled Stadiums</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global Locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Weather Conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-Paced, Competitive Action</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396110/extras/67f0c12bb8b182560385398607fc21f9.poster.avif?t=1780553669\" width=720 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396110/extras/67f0c12bb8b182560385398607fc21f9.webm?t=1780553669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396110/extras/67f0c12bb8b182560385398607fc21f9.mp4?t=1780553669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nosball is a high-skill, adrenaline-fueled car drifting soccer game that blends fast-paced sports action with demolition derby chaos. Precision driving, controlled drifting, and smart positioning are key as you battle for the ball while your car takes real damage from intense collisions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matches take place inside dangerous, pinball-styled arenas packed with obstacles that constantly disrupt the flow of play. Walls, ramps, and hazards turn every match into a high-speed test of control, timing, and survival, where one mistake can send your car flying, or completely destroy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396110/extras/9ae4f38c0435b53ff06e6dab547d5c27.avif?t=1780553669\" width=720 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stadium delivers a unique atmosphere, with locations inspired by real-world places from around the globe, including iconic settings like Mount Fuji. Dynamic weather conditions further raise the challenge, forcing players to adapt their driving style and master the physics in every match. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nosball is not about auto-aim or easy wins. It rewards skill, practice, and creativity, combining drifting, destruction, and soccer into a chaotic competitive experience. Fast, unforgiving, and built for players who want something more intense than traditional car soccer this is Nosball. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Yeah… some might call it a Rocket killer 😉)</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396110/extras/abe19842a6a74e8dcfe846f386b2490b.avif?t=1780553669\" width=720 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-Skill Car Drifting Soccer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demolition Derby Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball-Style Arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-Based Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrenaline-Filled Stadiums</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global Locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Weather Conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-Paced, Competitive Action</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Nosball is a fast-paced car drifting soccer game with demolition derby chaos. Smash rivals, master physics-based control, and score goals on dangerous pinball-style arenas set in global locations with dynamic weather.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396110/7e6ebc9f68ee81be451a7603108f5da79cc0c154/header.jpg?t=1780553669", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396110/6cbe9d273862d627ace821b83f3e374e8e7a7970/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780553669", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396110/6cbe9d273862d627ace821b83f3e374e8e7a7970/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780553669", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows Vista or greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB video memory, shader model 3.0+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Saviour Developments"], "publishers": ["Saviour Developments"], "demos": [{"appid": 4